The following modules adapt the CONTRACT SHAPE and PROTOCOL VALUES of Upstream's
provider plugin system (they are not a verbatim copy — Upstream is Effect + Vercel
AI SDK based, theokit is hand-rolled):

- src/internal/llm/responses.ts — the OpenAI Responses API SSE state machine is
  adapted from Upstream's `packages/upstream/src/plugin/openai/openai-responses.ts`.

- src/internal/auth/oauth-device.ts — the RFC 8628 device-grant poll loop
  (authorization_pending / slow_down handling) is adapted from
  `packages/upstream/src/plugin/github-copilot/copilot.ts`; the JWT-claim /
  account-id extraction and the OpenAI two-step "headless" device flow are adapted
  from `packages/upstream/src/plugin/openai/codex.ts`.

- src/internal/auth/oauth-engine.ts, src/internal/auth/credential-store.ts,
  src/types/provider-profile.ts (the `transform` seam) — the provider `auth.loader`
  contract shape (a provider owns its per-request auth material + transparent token
  refresh) is adapted from `packages/upstream/src/plugin/provider/*.ts`.

- src/internal/providers/catalog-source-models-dev.ts + scripts/refresh-catalog.mjs — the models.dev
  catalog consumption mechanism (disk cache + TTL + atomic write + fallback chain + kill-switch) is
  adapted from `packages/core/src/models-dev.ts`.

- src/internal/providers/builtin/openai-compatible.ts + the M45 data-provider leaves — the
  data-only profile-map pattern is adapted from `packages/llm/src/providers/openai-compatible-profile.ts`;
  the `anthropic-beta` constant and the openrouter/cerebras attribution-header MECHANISMS are adapted from
  `packages/core/src/plugin/provider/{anthropic,openrouter,cerebras}.ts` (header VALUES changed to theokit's
  own — referer/integration headers attribute traffic).

